[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:Ow!]
[00:00.74]Lesson 99 | 第99课
[00:02.54]Ow! | 哎哟！
[00:04.19]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音，然后回答问题。
[00:09.86]Must Andy go to see the doctor? | 安迪必须去看医生吗？
[00:14.66]Ow! | 哎哟！
[00:16.79]What's the matter, Andy? | 怎么了，安迪？
[00:19.79]I slipped and fell downstairs. | 我滑了一下，从楼上摔下来了。
[00:23.40]Have you hurt yourself? | 你摔伤了吗？
[00:26.12]Yes, I have. | 是的，我摔伤了。
[00:28.21]I think that I've hurt my back. | 我想我伤了背。
[00:32.04]Try and stand up. | 试试站起来。
[00:35.11]Can you stand up? | 你能站起来吗？
[00:37.24]Here. | 来。
[00:38.18]Let me help you. | 我来帮你。
[00:40.54]I'm sorry, Lucy. | 对不起，露西。
[00:43.58]I'm afraid that I can't get up. | 恐怕我站不起来。
[00:47.48]I think that the doctor had better see you. | 我认为你最好去看医生。
[00:52.50]I'll phone Dr. Carter. | 我给卡特医生打电话。
[00:56.30]The doctor says that he will come at once. | 医生说他马上就来。
[01:01.21]I'm sure that you need an X-ray, Andy. | 安迪，我肯定你需要拍X光片。